# Pins a stable chrome-extension://<id> across machines and reloads — committed on
# purpose (see .gitignore's note): not secret, it's the public half of a keypair that
# ends up in every built manifest.json anyway. Matches passwd-server's EXTENSION_ORIGIN
# (wrangler.toml for prod, .env for local dev) so any machine that builds this repo talks
# to a backend that already trusts it, with no per-device setup.
WXT_EXTENSION_DEV_
# Derived extension id (chrome://extensions will show this once loaded): jkhobgfeakjblkamfhebekmmcpffkond
